 "brief": "Human rights organizations from across the Arab world and internationally have called on the International Criminal Court to open an independent investigation into crimes targeting reproductive health in Gaza, Shehab Wire reported. The groups seek inquiry into the destruction of fertility clinics, assisted reproduction centers, and delivery facilities, along with investigation of the consequences for pregnant women, newborns, and future Palestinian generations.\n\nThe appeal centers on alleged systematic damage to reproductive healthcare infrastructure in the enclave and its broader demographic impact on the Palestinian population.",
